mation. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Machlian looks identical to Morridow, so it's hardly unusual that her virtual consciousness might possess memory fragments from the other person. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Of course, I'm not dismissing the possibility that Machlian could be Morridow. I'm just saying there might be another explanation."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're doing this on purpose."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, the Commander can see for themselves and make the final decision."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Put the video on the main screen."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All attempts to record information within that region failed. I cannot project it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then let's go into Machlian's mind again. Please watch, Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Right, let's go."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"82","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...In Machlian's room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander has returned together with ST AR-15 and Dandelion."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Hm? What's wrong?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We know everything, Morridow."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You may enter, ST AR-15."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dandelion opens the link, and the monitor shows Machlian's virtual cognition image."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is this...my mind?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Having come this way before, ST AR-15 navigates through the space with ease and makes her way to where the blank region was, but in its place is a chaotic mess of memory fragments."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why is this happening, Dandelion?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I do not know either."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"p